        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Warm Up a Cold Clip\n\nWarms a cold-looking video by lifting red and lowering blue. The grade runs through ffmpeg, so it needs no GPU.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Clip\" takes the video. \"2 Warm grade\" scales the red channel to 1.15, keeps green at 1.0 and drops blue to 0.85. \"3 Result\" returns the graded clip.\n\n**Try this:** Swap the values on \"2 Warm grade\" (red 0.85, blue 1.15) to cool a clip that looks too warm."
        },
